      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARLI MOO (8) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last four starts, the latest when second (39.70) at Murray Bridge. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from six starts. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Ready to find winning form. AKELA MARTIAL (6) had been going along well winning a Grade 5/6 three back then placing at Murray Bridge before missing the frame latest when fourth (40.07) at Murray Bridge. Solid beginner and with a good start can clear the tricky draw. Key player on best and worth another try. EXPRESS POLO (1) was a winner in quick time back then got further back last time but came home hard into third and beaten 10 lengths at this track (34.97). Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to be in this for a long way. JUST A LAD (4) deserves plenty of thought at his first run at this circuit.",
